# Everything the home server runs: the world server, the agent door, the two proxies and any inside.sh command. A
# takeover of all of it together can use this much of the machine and no more. A drop-in moves the numbers
# (`sudo systemctl edit eidoverse_home.slice`); each service has its own, smaller caps as well. The underscore is
# deliberate: a dash in a slice's name nests it under a parent slice.
[Unit]
Description=eidoverse home server: everything it runs

[Slice]
MemoryMax=6G
MemorySwapMax=0
TasksMax=768
CPUQuota=400%
